@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### Liste lesen (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stations
X-Correlation-ID: manual-list

### Einzelnen Datensatz lesen (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stations/1

### Gültigen Datensatz anlegen (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-create

{
  "stationCode": "N99",
  "name": "Neue Station",
  "address": "Neue Straße 1, Münster",
  "capacity": 12,
  "status": "PLANNED"
}

### Ungültigen Datensatz ablehnen (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-validation

{}

### Vorhandenen fachlichen Schlüssel ablehnen (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-conflict

{
  "stationCode": "DOM",
  "name": "Neue Station",
  "address": "Neue Straße 1, Münster",
  "capacity": 12,
  "status": "PLANNED"
}

### Seed-Datensatz mit unverändertem Schlüssel ersetzen (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/stations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stationCode": "DOM",
  "name": "Neue Station aktualisiert",
  "address": "Neue Straße 1, Münster",
  "capacity": 12,
  "status": "PLANNED"
}

### Unbekannten Datensatz idempotent löschen (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/stations/999999
